Apple remains on track to launch its first smart home device with a screen before the end of the year, according to <em>Bloomberg</em>'s <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-25/apple-to-launch-new-mac-mini-airpods-5-and-oled-ipad-mini-timing-details">Mark Gurman</a>.<br/>
<br/>
